  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">“Methods of Building Construction from A to Z”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nDepartment of Civil Engineering, ATMECE organized a technical talk on “Methods of Building Construction from A to Z” for 4th semester students on 12 th July 2021 with an objective to enhance one’s knowledge on Building construction. Er. Mushtaq Ameen, Structural Engineer, Ameen Corps Structural Consultancy, Chennai was the resource person for the technical talk conducted on 12th July 2021 at 11:15 AM on virtual mode. During his presentation, he spoke about the work sequencing in construction, materials used for the building construction at various stages and finally using the 3DS Max software he also showed the details of each construction work.\n\n<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Technical-Talk-12th-July-2021.pdf\"><strong>Report</strong></a>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
